              "value": "Moon Frenzy"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(polymorph, primal, transmutation)\n\nWhen a full moon appears in the night sky, the werewolf must enter hybrid form, can't Change Shape thereafter, becomes one size larger, increases its reach by 5 feet, and increases the damage of its jaws by 2. When the moon sets or the sun rises, the werewolf returns to humanoid form and is fatigued for 2d4 hours."
            },
